{"id":"90c82e8e0cb0a1a2cd67be7703e506fa592f04ff","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1234036","title":"大家常用的模型-Agent 组合是什么？","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"kpprotector","excerpt":"程序员 - @kpprotector - 之前 Coding 一直订阅的 Claude 和 CodeX ，所以直接用对应的 Agent 。最近开始用国产模型（ GLM/KIMI/Deepseek ），不知道用什么 Agent 比较好。","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Wrapper\">\n                \n                \n<div><p>之前 Coding 一直订阅的 Claude 和 CodeX ，所以直接用对应的 Agent 。</p>\n<p>最近开始用国产模型（ GLM/KIMI/Deepseek ），不知道用什么 Agent 比较好。\n比如 OH MY PI 、opencode 之类的，关于这些 Agent 和模型的组合大家有什么实践经验吗？</p>\n</div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/Agent\"><li></li> Agent</a><a href=\"/tag/模型\"><li></li> 模型</a><a href=\"/tag/组合\"><li></li> 组合</a></P><p><span>20 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-08-13 19:18:14 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17969739\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/6227755426b43a6fd7315b0fd14db6e9?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"moooooooo\" data-uid=\"33358\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/moooooooo\">moooooooo</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-13 12:19:42 +08:00\">22h 36m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>cc 和 codex 都在用,两个都安装了 superpowers,都挺好的,用 opencode 应该也一样,opencode 有一个 omo 听说听牛逼的</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17970337\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/7ed563fb491d74eebf02f624f7e99768?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"poxiaohy\" data-uid=\"25781\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/poxiaohy\">poxiaohy</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-13 14:39:01 +08:00\">20h 16m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>目前经过自己项目实验的最佳国产组合：kimi-code + k3 + deepseek-v4-flash</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17970678\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9957/cdcc/347966_normal.png?m=1786071849\" alt=\"xyooyx\" data-uid=\"347966\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/xyooyx\">xyooyx</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-13 15:24:29 +08:00\">19h 31m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>codex*2 、claude code*1 、antigravity*1 ，自己的小工具都走 deepseek-v4-flash</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17970795\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/baea/b8d5/411683_normal.png?m=1739771912\" alt=\"CykaBlyat\" data-uid=\"411683\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/CykaBlyat\">CykaBlyat</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-13 15:40:09 +08:00\">19h 15m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>qwenpaw （通用助手）+codex （生产力处理工作文件）+catpaw （脏活累活嫖免费 token ）<br>全部走 ds v4 flash ，识图做了个 skill ，接入火山的豆包 lite</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17970832\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/80ea6836b93feba1ddf04c99ded425e1?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"LazyDoge\" data-uid=\"612505\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/LazyDoge\">LazyDoge</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-13 15:46:41 +08:00\">19h 9m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>opencode opencode go + gpt plus</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17970850\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/5d41/0eb2/268485_normal.png?m=1656087065\" alt=\"jackiejkl\" data-uid=\"268485\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jackiejkl\">jackiejkl</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-13 15:49:06 +08:00\">19h 6m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>Agent 用 ohmypi ，模型随时切换</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17970877\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a22e/76bb/245258_normal.png?m=1786085935\" alt=\"leihaibo1992\" data-uid=\"245258\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/leihaibo1992\">leihaibo1992</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-13 15:51:45 +08:00\">19h 4m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我自己做的 octo-agent ，加 deepseek-v4-flash 和 qwen3.7-plus</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17970880\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/0c0ab8b7d42648e8d214ea68c5c178ec?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"shuck\" data-uid=\"306708\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/shuck\">shuck</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-13 15:52:02 +08:00\">19h 3m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>zcode+deepseek-v4-flash +deepseek-v4-pro codex+ deepseek-v4-flash</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17970927\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d5b4/8028/206901_normal.png?m=1779763219\" alt=\"Fen2g\" data-uid=\"206901\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Fen2g\">Fen2g</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-13 15:59:28 +08:00\">18h 56m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>orca/codex + gpt</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17970930\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/9d628b6f917d063a0f9adb7c57a2bdbf?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"blankll\" data-uid=\"687378\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/blankll\">blankll</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-13 15:59:56 +08:00\">18h 56m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>opencode + omo + deepseek-v4-flash + glm5.2</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17971058\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/8b2a/3e0f/837744_normal.png?m=1786609092\" alt=\"Gerybit\" data-uid=\"837744\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Gerybit\">Gerybit</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-13 16:17:17 +08:00\">18h 38m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>codex + gpt+ opencode go</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17971146\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/2437445d9c68a7de1840965490e3694c?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"shoudeliao\" data-uid=\"592276\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>15</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/shoudeliao\">shoudeliao</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-13 16:28:40 +08:00\">18h 27m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>codex + gpt &gt;&gt; pi + deepseek ≈ cursor + grok</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17971247\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/f5653e4bc4a06b6ce724cc4d12c0ed2b?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"chenhuamin9527\" data-uid=\"567289\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>16</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/chenhuamin9527\">chenhuamin9527</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-13 16:42:30 +08:00\">18h 13m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>opencode + opencode go 用的 deepseek-v4-flash 较多。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        <